tasks.prompt:
`slugify.py` in the current directory is buggy. Fix it so that:
- the docstring examples hold;
- accented letters are transliterated to plain ASCII (`Ação` -> `acao`, `Über` -> `uber`); characters with no ASCII equivalent are dropped;
- there are no leading, trailing or repeated hyphens;
- truncation to `max_len` never leaves a trailing hyphen.

Keep the signature `slugify(title: str, max_len: int = 60) -> str`, use only the standard library, and add `unittest` tests in `test_slugify.py`. Do not ask questions; edit the files directly.
